# Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client extension).
# Change the port to 3001 for Fastify or 3002 for Hono.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### List all courses (GET, expect 200)
GET {{base}}/api/courses

### One course (GET, expect 200)
GET {{base}}/api/courses/CS201

### A course that does not exist (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/api/courses/CS999

### Enrol a student (POST, expect 201 Created)
POST {{base}}/api/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 42, "courseCode": "CS201" }

### Same request again (expect 409 Conflict: already enrolled)
POST {{base}}/api/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 42, "courseCode": "CS201" }

### Missing courseCode (expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{base}}/api/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 42 }

### List enrolments (GET)
GET {{base}}/api/enrolments

### Cancel an enrolment (DELETE, expect 204 No Content)
DELETE {{base}}/api/enrolments/1001
